  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nCurrently the video tag can request any range, even a range that includes the entire video. This functionality should limit the megabits per second that the video will use.\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\nCurrently this does not have a standard solution for all browsers.\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\none or two attributes that will limit the video ranges in quantity and time\n\n### Anything else?\n\nI'd like you to hurry up; this would have to be done yesterday. The global internet traffic that could be saved by implementing this feature.",
